{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/3ab01c3fc7f07d67b9c9cbe452ce657b.avif?t=1753368933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras_big/3ab01c3fc7f07d67b9c9cbe452ce657b.avif?t=1753368933 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping <i><strong>action roguelike</strong></i> where you face endless waves of enemies! In Sweet Slaughter, choose a hero with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and battle against ever-increasing hordes of monsters. With each level-up, you can choose from <strong>Modifiers and Augments</strong> to enhance your stats and gain additional <strong>special effects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 15 minutes, a powerful <strong>boss</strong> appears, which you must defeat to successfully complete your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.poster.avif?t=1753368933\" width=800 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.webm?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303180/extras/9cd2587df34f2abe43b1817dab222189.mp4?t=1753368933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from various characters, each with unique <strong>abilities</strong> and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Choices</strong>: After selecting your <strong>Attribute Augments</strong>, you can unlock powerful <strong>Effect Augments</strong> that grant unique advantages in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Can you survive for 15 minutes against the hordes of monsters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a challenging experience that tests your <strong>skills</strong> and strategic decisions as you fight against cute but deadly monsters!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shrine Access","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/f1471681314f39bceec3db3b2c2bb3876dabaad6.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Attackpower Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/f04013265338a2a7a1527e4cc715823ed3d2d23c.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Max Health Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/b9cf1625bd2002ee471a7b5553ef856f6675ca60.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Health Regeneration Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/313baf4ab51e7e2250fde821bb8f62fa191e9cba.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Speed Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/2ac0e40138375bb2a3d19de06e2efd4e46275804.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Damage Reduction Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/920973ffba2322edec4d3e934048da13e4fd73b0.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Cooldown Reduction Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/3e449b4032a2e668e765a1198d35a3bd2876c9e5.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the improved Evasion Chance Shrine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3303180/c412cc82c0231bda050ff8d885d0a0f